  "helpFaqQ1": "What is My Vitals?",
  "helpFaqA1": "My Vitals is a personal health tracking app that lets you record and monitor your wellness indicators: anthropometric measurements, vital signs, lipid profile, and body composition.",
  "helpFaqQ2": "Is my data saved to the cloud?",
  "helpFaqA2": "No. All your data is stored exclusively on your device. My Vitals does not send any information to external servers, ensuring complete privacy.",
  "helpFaqQ3": "Can I use the app without internet?",
  "helpFaqA3": "Yes. My Vitals works completely offline. You only need connectivity for app updates.",
  "helpFaqQ4": "How do I enable biometric lock?",
  "helpFaqA4": "Go to Profile › Privacy & Security and enable the Biometric Lock toggle. Your device must have fingerprint or FaceID configured.",
  "helpFaqQ5": "How do I export my history?",
  "helpFaqA5": "In each history screen (Anthropometric, Vital Signs, etc.) you will find 'Export PDF' and 'Excel (CSV)' buttons at the top.",
  "helpFaqQ6": "Can I change the measurement units?",
  "helpFaqA6": "Yes. Go to Profile › Measurement Units and choose between Metric (kg, cm) or Imperial (lb, ft/in) system.",
  "helpFaqQ7": "What happens if I delete the app?",
  "helpFaqA7": "Uninstalling the app will permanently delete all locally stored data. We recommend exporting your history to PDF or CSV before uninstalling.",
  "helpFaqQ8": "Does this app replace my doctor?",
  "helpFaqA8": "No. My Vitals is a personal tracking tool to help you keep an organized record. Always consult a healthcare professional for medical interpretation and diagnosis.",
